=====Usage notes=====
* The comparative {{m|en|gooder}} and superlative {{m|en|goodest}} are [[nonstandard]].  In informal (often jocular) contexts, ''[[best]]'' may be inflected further and given the comparative ''[[bester]]'' and the superlative ''[[bestest]]''; these forms are also nonstandard<!--if you update this usage note, also update the one in [[best]]-->.

